# Name: AdsPower
# Description: Surge Rule-Set for AdsPower (Web, macOS/iOS Client & Built-in Browser Kernels)
# Behavior: RULE-SET (Do NOT use as DOMAIN-SET because it contains PROCESS-NAME rules)

# --- 1. AdsPower 核心域名（网页后台 / 客户端 API / 内核更新 / iOS 端通信） ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adspower.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adspower.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adspower.io

# --- 2. 本地 API 域名（建议在主配置中单独走 DIRECT，若需统一接管可保留） ---
# DOMAIN,local.adspower.net

# --- 3. macOS 客户端主进程 ---
PROCESS-NAME,AdsPower Global
PROCESS-NAME,AdsPower
PROCESS-NAME,AdsPower*

# --- 4. macOS 客户端打开的指纹浏览器内核进程 ---
PROCESS-NAME,SunBrowser
PROCESS-NAME,SunBrowser*
PROCESS-NAME,FlowerBrowser
PROCESS-NAME,FlowerBrowser*
